# MediSense Frontend — Implementation Plan

## Overview
Scaffold a production-grade React 18 + TypeScript frontend at `e:\agent\frontend\` that covers:
- **Phase 1**: Project scaffolding (package.json, Vite, Tailwind, i18n, ESLint/Prettier, Vitest, App.tsx router)
- **Phase 2**: API layer (types.ts, client.ts, auth.ts, reports.ts, queries.ts, claims.ts)
- **Phase 3**: Zustand stores (authStore, rateLimitStore, sessionStore, languageStore)
- **Phase 4**: Auth pages + components (Login, Register, ProtectedRoute, RateLimitBanner, authStore, useTokenRefresh)
- **Phase 5**: Report upload components (ReportUpload, ValueConfirmation, ReportValues, ABHAConnect, ConsentStatus, ReportPage, useRateLimit)
- **Phase 6**: Unit tests for all above

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The frontend lives at `e:\agent\frontend\` as a standalone Vite project (not inside the Spring Boot src tree).

