## Phase 3 — Zustand Stores

### [NEW] `src/store/authStore.ts`
State: `user | null`, `access_token | null`, `refresh_token | null`, `is_authenticated`, `failed_login_attempts`
Actions: `login()`, `logout()`, `refreshToken()`, `setLanguagePref()`
Token strategy: access_token in-memory only; refresh via httpOnly cookie on page reload.

### [NEW] `src/store/rateLimitStore.ts`
State: `Map<endpoint_slug, RateLimitInfo>`
Actions: `setRateLimit(endpoint, info)`, `clearRateLimit(endpoint)`, `getRateLimit(endpoint)`

### [NEW] `src/store/sessionStore.ts`
State: `session_id`, `report_loaded`, `lab_values[]`, `prescriptions[]`

### [NEW] `src/store/languageStore.ts`
State: `language: 'en' | 'ta'`
Actions: `setLanguage()`

