## Phase 5 — Report Upload Components

### [NEW] `src/hooks/useRateLimit.ts`
Reads rateLimitStore. Returns `{ remaining, reset_at, is_limited, countdown }`. Countdown via `setInterval`.

### [NEW] `src/components/report/ReportUpload.tsx`
React Dropzone: PDF only, 10MB max. States: idle, drag-active, file-selected, uploading, success, error variants. Report type toggle. Pre-upload quota check.

### [NEW] `src/components/report/ValueConfirmation.tsx`
For each low-confidence value: confirm or edit mode. Numeric input + unit selector. Calls `POST /reports/confirm-value` per value.

### [NEW] `src/components/report/ReportValues.tsx`
Table view for lab values (status badges). Card view for prescriptions. "Ask about this →" pre-fills QueryInput.

### [NEW] `src/components/abdm/ABHAConnect.tsx`
3-step flow: ABHA address → date range → record type selector. Submits `POST /reports/abdm-pull`.

### [NEW] `src/components/abdm/ConsentStatus.tsx`
Polling with 10-second minimum interval, 5-minute timeout. Transitions to ReportValues on success.

### [NEW] `src/pages/dashboard/ReportPage.tsx`
Split 40/60 layout. Left: upload toggle. Right: empty state or ReportValues.

